From: AI Browser Control <ai-control@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Project tab colors as complete browser themes

Turn externally supplied tab colors into complete tab palettes and project the
active tab color through a temporary per-window BrowserThemePack. This keeps
normal, hover, selected, foreground, stroke, toolbar and omnibox colors
coherent without changing the profile's saved theme.

